                     --zzLLTT      11999900‐‐0011‐‐1111 2200::0000::0000--0088
                     --zz++0055::3300  11999900‐‐0011‐‐1122 0099::3300::0000++0055::3300

EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
           rrlloogg  --LL  --RR  RRCCSS//**
           rrlloogg  --LL  --hh  RRCCSS//**
           rrlloogg  --LL  --ll  RRCCSS//**
           rrlloogg  RRCCSS//**

       The first command prints the names of all RCS files in the subdirectory
       RRCCSS that have locks.  The second command prints the  headers  of  those
       files,  and  the  third prints the headers plus the log messages of the
       locked revisions.  The last command prints complete information.

