BBUUGGSS
       The separator for revision ranges in the --rr option used to be -- instead
       of  ::,  but this leads to confusion when symbolic names contain --.  For
       backwards compatibility rrlloogg --rr still supports the old -- separator, but
       it warns about this obsolete use.

